{
  "description": [
    {
      "content": "<p>Drags the tabset it is rendered within; render it within the content returned by the Workspace's <code>renderTabsetToolbar</code> prop:</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "code": true,
      "content": "<div><span class=\"tok-variableName\">renderTabsetToolbar</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">=</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetDragHandle</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#62;</span><span class=\"\">&#10303;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#60;/</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetDragHandle</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#62;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">}</span></div>"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>By default, a tabset is dragged by the empty space in its header;\nonce its header contains a drag handle, only the handle drags it.\nAny element with a <code>data-tabset-drag-handle</code> attribute is a drag handle;\nthis component also sets <code>touch-action: none</code>, so that it can be dragged by touch.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>The handle has a <code>data-disabled</code> attribute when the tabset can't be dragged (see <code>useParentTabsetState</code>), e.g. to hide it.\nIts <code>children</code>, <code>className</code>, <code>style</code>, and <code>title</code> can also be functions of its state (see <code>TabsetDragHandleState</code>):</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "code": true,
      "content": "<div><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetDragHandle</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">title</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">=</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">isDisabled</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">isDisabled</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">?</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">undefined</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-string\">\"Drag tabset\"</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#62;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  &#10303;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#60;/</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetDragHandle</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#62;</span></div>"
    }
  ],
